  "excerpt": "No. 76 in my ranking, four stars. Down in Noge's underground, friends gather around sashimi, sushi, tempura and namero. We circle items on the handwritten \"recommended fresh fish\" list and drink over white fish seared with its scales on and tempura like blooming flowers. A write-up of the perfect first stop for a bar-hop.",
