   "## I Just Want to Drink Cheaply. But I Want to Enjoy the Food Too",
   "When planning a gathering, budget matters. If you meet with friends regularly, you can't go to a high-end place every time. Some days you want a casual drink after work. Some days you want to go on to a second and third place. At times like that, a place with reasonably priced food is reassuring.",
   "The menu in Menoji's photos shows snacks in the few-hundred-yen range, sushi by the piece, and relatively affordable platters. At these prices, there's pleasure in building your order.",
